T Fishing pole
# FLEX makes every rod a bending beam instead of rigid structure. A braced frame is genuinely rigid,
# but a slender chain of rods is not: wave this and it whips, exactly like the real thing.
# Grab the tip in the bench, with the mouse or with your hand, and shake it.
FLEX
! butt: clamped to the table
C H0 W8 0,0,1.5 x y
C H1 W8 0,0,0.5 x y
R H0 H1
A H1
! the pole: eight red rods end to end, each one bending
C P1 W8 0,4,1.5 x y
C P2 W8 0,8,1.5 x y
C P3 W8 0,12,1.5 x y
C P4 W8 0,16,1.5 x y
C P5 W8 0,20,1.5 x y
C P6 W8 0,24,1.5 x y
C P7 W8 0,28,1.5 x y
R H0 P1
R P1 P2
R P2 P3
R P3 P4
R P4 P5
R P5 P6
R P6 P7
F P7 0,0,-2 tip
